@startuml
title Message can be lost before Kafka (Without Outbox)
participant "ShareTrip API" as ShareTrip
database "Trip DB" as TripDB
queue "Kafka" as Kafka
participant "Notification Service" as Notification

ShareTrip -> TripDB : BEGIN TX
ShareTrip -> TripDB : UPDATE trips SET status='published'
ShareTrip -> TripDB : COMMIT TX
TripDB --> ShareTrip : committed

ShareTrip -> Kafka : publish TripPublished
note right of ShareTrip
Network failure / Kafka is down.
Trip is published in DB,
but Event is LOST.
end note
Kafka --> ShareTrip : error / timeout

Kafka -[#red]-> Notification : no message delivered
@enduml
